---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/common/Section.astro';
import GlassPanel from '../components/common/GlassPanel.astro';
import { Scale, CheckCircle2, ShieldAlert, Cpu, FileCode2, ArrowLeft } from 'lucide-preact';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms and Conditions — Bloom Platform"
  description="Terms and Conditions for using Bloom Framework, Bloom CLI, and Bloom Cloud OTA Services."
  petalHighlight="all"
  nextChapterTitle="Privacy Policy"
  nextChapterLink="/privacy"
  nextChapterSubtitle="Read our transparent data governance and telemetry policies."
>
  <Section reveal={false} className="pt-16 pb-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12">
    <!-- Breadcrumb / Back -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-purple-400 transition flex items-center gap-1">
        <ArrowLeft className="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
        <span>Hub</span>
      </a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-slate-300">Terms & Conditions</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="space-y-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-zinc-800 pb-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 text-xs font-mono font-bold">
        <Scale className="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
        <span>Legal Terms & Licensing</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        Terms and Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm font-mono">
        Last updated: August 15, 2026 • Version 1.2
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="space-y-10 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-950/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <FileCode2 className="w-5 h-5 text-purple-400" />
          <span>1. Open Source MIT License</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          The Bloom Framework, CLI tools, runtime controllers, and UI primitives are open-source software distributed under the terms of the <strong>MIT License</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          You are free to use, modify, distribute, sublicense, and deploy Bloom in commercial and proprietary applications without paying licensing fees or royalties. You retain 100% intellectual property ownership of all applications, widgets, data schemas, and assets you create with Bloom.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-950/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <Cpu className="w-5 h-5 text-blue-400" />
          <span>2. Bloom Cloud & OTA Services</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          Bloom Cloud provides over-the-air code patch hosting, channel routing, and health telemetry. By using Bloom Cloud OTA services:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li>You agree not to deploy malicious bytecode, rootkits, spyware, or unauthorized data harvesting mechanisms to client devices.</li>
          <li>You agree to comply with Apple App Store Review Guidelines (section 3.3.2) and Google Play Developer Program Policies regarding runtime patch distribution.</li>
          <li>We reserve the right to suspend OTA channels that violate safety policies or generate severe security incidents.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-950/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <CheckCircle2 className="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" />
          <span>3. User Ownership & Zero Lock-in</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          Bloom is engineered around a strict <strong>Zero Vendor Lock-in</strong> philosophy:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 pl-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li>Bloom UI primitives are copied directly into your project as standard Flutter Dart files (<code class="font-mono text-purple-400">lib/bloom_ui/</code>).</li>
          <li>All generated routing tables use standard Flutter <code class="font-mono text-purple-400">go_router</code> packages.</li>
          <li>You can eject from the Bloom CLI tooling at any point while retaining full compilability of your Flutter codebase.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-950/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <ShieldAlert className="w-5 h-5 text-amber-400" />
          <span>4. Disclaimer of Warranties</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          THE SOFTWARE AND SERVICES ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="space-y-3 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-950/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <Scale className="w-5 h-5 text-purple-400" />
          <span>5. Modifications to Terms</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms periodically. Continued use of Bloom Cloud services following any published changes signifies acceptance of the updated terms.
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-purple-400">
          legal@bloomframework.org • github.com/bloom-framework/bloom
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </Section>
</Layout>
